    description: "FOUND 2026-11-01 during the P4 review (batch ctrl1, WI-gukoh control) at dev 9ae4abe13f. Fixture ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/ctrl1/fx_gukoh: a forward slice of service_b has 12 edges, of which only 10 are closed. The 2 open edges are imports lib/core.py:file -> normalize and -> os, whose source file node is not in the slice. Cause: the BFS reaches class Engine through an instantiates edge, and slice.py:903-908 calls add_file_imports for ANY reached container-kind node. INV-tarol-suloj-tohan-fuvif-dulom-badoj-gihij-difak (P1, satisfied) fixed only the function-entry case. Reverse slices are unaffected: the reverse BFS never calls add_file_imports. Invariant: every edge in a slice has both endpoints in the slice."  # ea72
