  message: "2026-11-07 docstring audit (dev 4f2feb451b): a second site breaks the same closure. Class expansion calls add_file_imports(member.path) with no kind check (slice.py:676-677). Go type Foo struct{} in a.go and func (f Foo) Bar() in b.go importing os: hypergumbo slice . --entry Foo includes b.go:file imports os, though b.go's file node is not in the slice. A fix that enforces 'every slice edge has both endpoints in the slice' closes both sites. r19, v07."  # f65c
